.TH PACEGHOST 1 "2026-11-27" "paceghost 0.1.0" "Spectacle Line Manual"
.SH NAME
paceghost \- offline agent window-pacing projector and exact rational meet statistics reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpaceghost\fR [\fB-h\fR | \fB--help\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR \fIFILE\fR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBpaceghost\fR reads recorded agent task runs, fields, single-window field days, window ladders, two-day rematches, and multi-day meets from local JSON files. All full-window projections and chaser-pack order statistics run over exact arbitrary-precision BigRational arithmetic with zero network calls and zero scheduling.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBshow <run.json>\fR
Display a recorded run and its phase splits.
.TP
\fBghost <run.json> [<run2.json> ...]\fR
Select the fastest standing ghost across matching runs.
.TP
\fBrace <ghost.json> <live.json>\fR
Compare split-by-split deltas of a live run against a standing ghost.
.TP
\fBseason <field.json> <ghost.json>\fR
Summarize per-model run counts and budget usage across a season field against a standing ghost.
.TP
\fBboard <run.json> <ghost.json>\fR
Project full-window token consumption at each timed checkpoint read against budget and a standing ghost.
.TP
\fBfieldday <field-day.json>\fR
Walk the chronological stolen-record progression across one window.
.TP
\fBladder <ladder.json>\fR
Evaluate record holders across an ordered list of window cutoffs.
.TP
\fBrematch <rematch.json>\fR
Walk a continuous record progression across two consecutive field days.
.TP
\fBmeet | table | reign | days | forks | marks | standings | traces | margins | spread | middle | tails | mean | median | quartiles | range | midhinge | midrange | width <meet.json>\fR
Run the nineteen multi-day meet progression and chaser-field statistical readings.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
Valid JSON loaded, report preconditions met, and report printed cleanly.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Malformed JSON refused with defect lines, unmet report precondition, or closed stdout pipe.
.TP
\fB2\fR
Unknown subcommand, unrecognized option, or wrong argument count.
.SH EXAMPLES
Display a recorded run
.nf
.RS 4
paceghost show examples/operator-run.json
.RE
.fi
.PP
Project checkpoint burn against a budget window and standing ghost
.nf
.RS 4
paceghost board examples/board-run.json examples/ghost-run.json
.RE
.fi
.PP
Compute exact rational chaser quartiles across a meet
.nf
.RS 4
paceghost quartiles examples/meet.json
.RE
.fi
